            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Data files:\n<ul>\n<li>Dataset.xlsx\n<li>Commands stata.pdf\n</ul>\nSupplemental material:\n<ul>\n<li>Variable code book.\n<li>Coding scheme.\n<li>List of rulings.\n<li>Professional translations of 5 rulings, funded by the Special Data Collection Requests Fund (BAD) – Tilburg University.\n</ul>\nStructure data package:\n<ul>\n<li>The dataset results from coding the decisions in the list of rulings.\n<li>The variable codebook describes each variable in the dataset’s columns. \n<li>The coding scheme describes the rules of coding. \n<li>The dataset was exported to Stata and analysed using the listed commands. \n</ul>"
